{"text": "At once the tree burst into blossom, and the boy kissed the Giant. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The other children saw this and came running back. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is your garden now, little children, said the Giant. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he took a great axe and knocked down the wall. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The children came every day, but the little boy never came again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Years later, on a winter morning, the old Giant saw a wonderful tree. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was covered with white blossoms, and the little boy was standing under it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Giant saw marks of nails on his hands and cried, Who has hurt you. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> These are the wounds of Love, said the child, You let me play in your garden once. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Today you will come with me to my garden, which is Paradise. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That afternoon the children found the Giant under the tree, covered with white blossoms.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "t", " ", "o", "n", "c", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "r", "e", "e", " ", "b", "u", "r", "s", "t", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "b", "l", "o", "s", "s", "o", "m", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "o", "y", " ", "k", "i", "s", "s", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "G", "i", "a", "n", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "c", "h", "i", "l", "d", "r", "e", "n", " ", "s", "a", "w", " ", "t", "h", "i", "s", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", " ", "r", "u", "n", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "b", "a", "c", "k", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "g", "a", "r", "d", "e", "n", " ", "n", "o", "w", ",", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "c", "h", "